evā"],"author":["by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["ki-rūpe pāiba sevā muñi durāchāra","śrī-guru-vaiṣṇave rati nā haila āmāra"],"translation":["How will I attain service? I am a sinner and have no attachment to Śrī Guru or the Vaiṣṇavas."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["aśeṣa māyāte mana magana ha-ila","vaiṣṇavete leśa-mātra rati nā janmila"],"translation":["My mind has become immersed in neverending illusion. I do not have even a trace of attachment to the Vaiṣṇavas."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["viṣaye bhuliyā andha ha-inu divā-niśi","gale phā̐sa dite phere māyā se piśāchī"],"translation":["Immersed in the mundane day and night, I have forgotten you and become blind. The witch Māyā has come to place a noose around my neck."],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["māyāre kariyā jaya chhāḍāna nā yāya","sādhu-kṛpā vinā āra nāhika upāya"],"translation":["It is impossible to overcome and leave behind Māyā without the sādhus’ mercy. There is no other way."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["adoṣa-daraśi-prabhu patita-uddhāra","ei-bāra narottame karaha nistāra"],"translation":["O master who overlooks my faults! O saviour of the fallen! This time deliver Narottam Dās."],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/kostya-netrebenko/015-kirupepaibaseva-7","personSlug":"srila-b-n-acharya-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/ki-rupe-paibo-seva","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Ki-rūpe-pāiba-sevā-02-22"},"head":{"canonical":"/en-pe/ki-rupe-paibo-seva-mui-durachara/","description":"Ki-rūpe pāiba sevā — a Vaiṣṇava song by Śrīla Narottam Dās Ṭhākur with lyrics, English translation and word-by-word meaning. From Pocket Kirtan Guide.","title":"Ki-rūpe pāiba sevā. by